OL,3,GNEWSAHeadliners revealed for Isle of
OL,4,AWight Festival 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FFatboy Slim, Robbie Williams and Kings
OL,7,Fof Leon have been announced as
OL,8,Fheadliners for next year's Isle of
OL,9,FWight Festival.
OL,11,FThe festival, due to take place from
OL,12,F17-20 June 2027 at Seaclose Park in
OL,13,FNewport, will be celebrating the 25th
OL,14,Fanniversary of its revival.
OL,16,FFestival director Caroline Giddings
OL,17,Fsaid next year's line up had a "real
OL,18,Fmix of artists".
OL,20,FThe future of the event was secured
OL,21,Funtil 2033 when its licence was renewed
OL,22,Fin October.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
